125	Then $M_{\text{global}}^{-1} M_s = I + M_{\text{global}}^{-1} \Delta_s$, so:
126	\begin{equation}
127	\text{bias}_{\text{global}}(z, s) = [M_{\text{global}}^{-1} \Delta_s \cdot \boldsymbol{\tau}]_z.
